{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「週刊プレイボーイ×TOKYO IDOL FESTIVAL 2016 公式BOOK『ナツ☆イチッ！～この夏、輝くアイドル全員集合～』 」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に載ってると書きましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「週刊プレイボーイNo.32」\nの方にも載ってました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の『ミニ写真集１２ページ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の写真集発売前に\nチラ見せって感じです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/26/0344372/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女子校組のカットあるよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかもこの写真集の撮影の時にはまだ\n『口約束』を頂く前だったから\nまだユニットでもないし\n知る人ぞ知るただの仲良しの集まり\nってだけだったから\n4人で撮影できたの嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/26/0344372/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ見て写真集楽しみにしててください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前出演した乃木ののの写メが\nHPの方にアップされてました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラッパーと言われていたファッションが露に！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラッパー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...じゃないよね？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/26/0344372/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お待たせしました\n飯ぺろです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいもやさん 興伸"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"創業140年という老舗中の老舗です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/26/0344372/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大学いも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"季節によってお芋の品種が変わるらし！\nこだわりすごい！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/26/0344372/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"袋に芋を入れた後に\n上からたっぷり蜜をかけてくれるんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまらん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１個が大きくてほくほく\n蜜は水飴のシンプルな味でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１つ前のブログの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「この中田、\n何が起こった後の表情でしょう？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の答え"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/26/0344372/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"琴子ちゃんと写メ撮ろうとしたら\n逃げられた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/26/0344372/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}